		{
			"id": "TU0zax5JvlduRZmcI",
			"name": "Electrokinetic Surfing",
			"local_notes": "Keywords: Buff\nFull Cost:  points/level. \nCasting Roll: None. Use Innate Attack () to hit.\nRange:  \nDuration: \n\n\nYou manifest a field of electricity underneath your feet, creating a buffer between you and the ground, mitigating terrain differences. Additionally, you can move double your move for 20 turns. You may attach this to an ally for the duration.",
			"tags": [
				"Weather"
			],
			"vtt_notes": "You manifest a field of electricity underneath your feet, creating a buffer between you and the ground, mitigating terrain differences. Additionally, you can move double your move for 20 seconds (turns). You may attach this to an ally for the duration. It costs 1 vraul per minute (same for maintenance)",
