								"path": "Home Brew\\Enraged Eggplant\\Magic\\Sorcery Spells.adq",
								"id": "toa47tryG7Xp00H05"
							},
							"name": "Cure Wounds",
							"reference": "B59",
							"local_notes": "Keywords: None. \nFull Cost: 45 points.\nCasting Roll: IQ for healing. Use DX or unarmed combat skills to hit. \nRange: Touch. \nDuration: Instantaneous. \n\nWhen casting this spell, you must declare whether you are trying to heal a living subject or harm an undead subject. Thus, if you are somehow deceived by the appearance and try to heal an undead subject or harm a living subject, the spell fails. \n\nOn living subjects, this spell works identically to Minor Healing (GURPS Thaumatology: Sorcery, p. 17). However, it can affect any living creature, not only humans and similar races, and the caster cannot affect himself. \n\nOn undead subjects, this spell deals 1d injury regardless of DR and insubstantiality.",
							"tags": [
								"Advantage",
								"Exotic",
								"Mental"
							],
							"vtt_notes": "Keywords: None. \nFull Cost: 45 points.\nCasting Roll: IQ for healing. Use DX or unarmed combat skills to hit. \nRange: Touch. \nDuration: Instantaneous. \n\nWhen casting this spell, you must declare whether you are trying to heal a living subject or harm an undead subject. Thus, if you are somehow deceived by the appearance and try to heal an undead subject or harm a living subject, the spell fails. \n\nOn living subjects, this spell works identically to Minor Healing (GURPS Thaumatology: Sorcery, p. 17). However, it can affect any living creature, not only humans and similar races, and the caster cannot affect himself. \n\nOn undead subjects, this spell deals 1d injury regardless of DR and insubstantiality.",
